CREATED:20260511T193648Z
DESCRIPTION:We have a special program scheduled for this Wednesday's meeti
 ng of Duke Toastmasters: an Open House.\n\nJoin us in person or online to
  learn more about Toastmasters\, how it can help you build confidence and
  skills in public speaking through regular practice and feedback. We'll d
 emo some of the ways we learn to speak more smoothly and there will even 
 be a chance for you to give it a try by answering a simple prompt (it's o
 ptional!). We'll let you know how to join the club and begin your journey
  with Toastmasters.\n\nDuke Toastmasters is a small group of people assoc
 iated with Duke and from the community. We meet in a supportive and frien
 dly and fun environment to support each other and improve our ability to 
 think on our feet.
DURATION:PT1H
DTSTAMP:20260511T213332Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260513T071500
LAST-MODIFIED:20260511T213332Z
